msgstr "In the main SD, requests use the ``sd-reg-number-template`` numbering template and the ``SD-{{_docNum}}`` identifier format. The standard main portal configuration exports the ``_docNum`` number and ``_status`` status to the external portal. Initial request creation and number assignment on the external side depend on its application configuration."

